Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.64,0:21:56.49,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,解码、转换、缩放，都放在模型里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}decode, convert, resize, inside the model.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.81,0:22:00.60,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,有一个小疏漏：README 把这件事交给了模型部署\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A small slip: the README gives this job to model deploy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.92,0:22:02.99,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,其实是训练脚本做的。第 3 步\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The trainer does it. Step 3:
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.99,0:22:08.52,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,sh package-trainer.sh 把 package 目录打包，再拷到 S3\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}sh package-trainer.sh packs the package folder and copies it to S3.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.84,0:22:10.44,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个 tar 文件是真的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The tar file is real.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.72,0:22:12.68,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,上传因为我们的假密钥失败了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The upload fails on our fake key.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.92,0:22:16.44,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 4 步：python cli.py --train\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 4: python cli.py --train.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.76,0:22:21.45,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它问 AWS 你是谁，用来拼出角色的 ARN，然后就停在那里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It asks AWS who you are, to build the role ARN, and stops there.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.77,0:22:24.74,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,有密钥时，它会启动一个训练任务\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}With keys, it starts a training job
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.74,0:22:27.87,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,跑在 ml.m5.xlarge 上，并且马上返回\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}on ml.m5.xlarge, and returns at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.12,0:22:32.66,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 5 步：在控制台里看，Training 下面的 Training jobs\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 5: watch it in the console, under Training, then Training jobs.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.98,0:22:34.62,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它的名字以 cheese 开头\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Its name starts with cheese.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.97,0:22:37.30,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,构建并 push\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Build and push.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.35,0:22:40.30,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,README 说这一步已经替你做好了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The README says this step has already been done for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.62,0:22:43.77,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,有一个小疏漏：workflow 代码拉取的两个 image\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A small gap: the workflow code pulls both images
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.77,0:22:49.02,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,来自你自己账号的 ECR registry，所以你得自己 push，每个一次\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}from the ECR registry of your own account, so you push them yourself, once each.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.27,0:22:53.50,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这正是课上为自己的 container 列的第二步\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}That is the second step the lecture gives for your own containers:
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.50,0:22:57.16,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,把 image push 到平台能拉取的 registry\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}push the images to a registry the platform can pull from.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.40,0:23:01.50,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 1 到第 3 步走 Docker Hub：登录、构建、push\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Steps 1 to 3 go through Docker Hub: log in, build, push.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.82,0:23:06.40,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Mac 那一行构建 amd64，因为 SageMaker 跑的就是它\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The Mac line builds amd64, because SageMaker runs that.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.05,0:23:09.05,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 4 步设置五个变量\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 4 sets five variables.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.37,0:23:13.12,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,照原样贴进去，第一行会打印两个报错\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pasted exactly as written, the first line prints two errors,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.12,0:23:17.61,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,因为 export 不接受那段方括号注释，不过区域还是设上了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}because export rejects the bracket note, though the region is still set.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.93,0:23:22.43,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,账号查询因为我们的假密钥失败了，URI 就以一个点开头\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The account lookup fails on our fake key, and the URI starts with a dot.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.67,0:23:25.33,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,所以只贴值：us-east-1\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}So paste only the value, us-east-1.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.65,0:23:31.03,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,如果你的 URI 以点开头，就说明账号查询失败了：先修好你的密钥\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}And if your URI starts with a dot, the account lookup failed: fix your keys first.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.27,0:23:33.02,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 5 步拉取你的 image\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 5 pulls your image.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.34,0:23:38.58,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 6 步创建仓库，结尾的 || true 把报错藏起来了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 6 creates the repository, and the || true at the end hides the error:
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.58,0:23:40.57,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,命令以 0 退出\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the command exits with zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.82,0:23:43.74,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 7 到第 11 步：让 Docker 登录 ECR\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Steps 7 to 11 log Docker in to ECR,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.74,0:23:48.01,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,给 image 打 tag，push，列出来，再打印 URI\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}tag the image, push it, list it, and print the URI.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.33,0:23:51.33,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,打 tag 只是给同一个 image 加第二个名字\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Tag only adds a second name to the same image.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.65,0:23:54.96,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在你的笔记本上跑，别在 workflow container 里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Run them on your laptop, not in the workflow container,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.96,0:23:56.65,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,那里没有 docker 命令\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}which has no docker command.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.97,0:23:59.04,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后对数据处理器的 image 再做一遍\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Then repeat for the processor image.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.05,0:24:06.89,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,自动化数据采集器，第 1 步，在 workflow 目录里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Automate the data collector, step 1, in the workflow folder.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.21,0:24:11.95,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在你跑 sh docker-shell.sh 之前，星号的问题又回来了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Before you run sh docker-shell.sh, the "*" problem returns.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.27,0:24:13.90,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,虽然 commit 了一个 lock 文件\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A lock is committed,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.90,0:24:18.97,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,可 Dockerfile 只复制 Pipfile，所以构建会解析出版本 3\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}but the Dockerfile copies only the Pipfile, so the build would resolve version 3.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.20,0:24:21.12,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,检查结果显示导入失败了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The checks show the imports failing.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.44,0:24:24.28,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,所以先做同样的修复：小于 3\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}So make the same fix first: "<3".
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.33,0:24:32.98,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,现在跑 sh docker-shell.sh\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Now run sh docker-shell.sh.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.30,0:24:37.03,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,横幅显示区域和 bucket，身份检查失败了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The banner shows region and bucket, and the who am I check fails.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.35,0:24:41.45,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,额外检查：现在是 SageMaker 版本 2，而且没有 docker 命令\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Extras: SageMaker version 2 now, and no docker command.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.77,0:24:45.44,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Docker 的 socket 挂进来了，但里面没有 docker 程序\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The socket is mounted, but no docker program is inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.68,0:24:50.16,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,从这里开始，SDK 就是你的遥控器，课上就是这么说的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}From here, the SDK is your remote control, as the lecture puts it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.48,0:24:53.68,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,你的 Python 发出请求，AWS 的机器去跑\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Your Python asks, and AWS machines run.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.05,0:24:58.13,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 2 步：带上 data collector 参数，跑 python cli.py\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 2: python cli.py --data_collector.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.45,0:24:59.89,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它停在第 32 行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It stops at line 32,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.89,0:25:04.99,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,那是文件顶部对你账号的一次查询，函数还没开始\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}a lookup of your account at the top of the file, before the function even starts.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.31,0:25:09.35,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个 CLI 的每个参数，在导入时都需要一个能用的密钥\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Every flag of this CLI needs a working key at import time.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.58,0:25:12.17,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,有密钥时，它建一个 processor\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}With keys, it builds a processor
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.17,0:25:15.49,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,用你 ECR 里的 image，跑在一台 ml.t3.medium 上\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}from your ECR image, on one ml.t3.medium.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.81,0:25:20.16,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它的 entrypoint 是 python3 加上采集器的 cli.py\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Its entry point is python3 with the collector cli.py.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.48,0:25:25.05,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后带着搜索参数运行这个任务，一边等一边显示日志\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Then it runs the job with the search arguments, and waits, showing the logs.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.32,0:25:26.92,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这就是生产模式\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}This is production mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.09,0:25:30.76,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,SageMaker 在参数前面放上它自己的命令\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}SageMaker puts its own command in front of the arguments.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.08,0:25:33.08,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,同一个 image，同一个 cli.py\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Same image, same cli.py,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.08,0:25:35.83,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,跑在一台你从来不用登录的机器上\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}on a machine you never log in to.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.15,0:25:38.78,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个任务以角色的身份运行，用的不是你的密钥\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The job acts as the role, not with your key.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.00,0:25:43.78,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 3 步：在 Processing 下面的 Processing jobs 里看\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 3: watch it under Processing, then Processing jobs.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.75,0:25:47.35,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,现在看整条 pipeline\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Now the whole pipeline.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.56,0:25:50.93,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,课件用 Kubeflow 的 DSL 写步骤\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The slides write steps in the Kubeflow DSL,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.93,0:25:53.90,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,用 .output 连起来，再编译成 YAML\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}wired by .output and compiled to YAML.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.22,0:25:58.53,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这里是 SageMaker 的步骤类、属性引用和 JSON\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Here: SageMaker step classes, property references and JSON.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.47,0:26:01.60,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,首先是缓存，30 天\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}First, caching, for 30 days.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.92,0:26:05.66,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第一步是一个叫 DataCollector 的处理步骤\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The first step is a processing step named DataCollector,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.66,0:26:08.00,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,声明了一个输出：raw-data\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}with one declared output, raw-data.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.25,0:26:13.69,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第二步是数据处理器，它的输入是采集器的一个属性\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The second step, the processor, takes as input a property of the collector:
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.69,0:26:15.72,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它的 raw-data 输出的 S3 URI\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}its raw-data output, S3 URI.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.04,0:26:18.85,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,不是字符串，而是一个引用，它画出一条边\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Not a string: a reference, and it draws an edge.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.62,0:26:23.88,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,训练用同样的方式拿处理器的 TFRecords 输出\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Training takes the TFRecords output of the processor the same way,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.88,0:26:27.30,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,模型步骤拿训练出来的模型产物\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and the model step takes the trained model artifacts.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.62,0:26:29.77,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,每个引用都多画出一条边\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Each reference draws one more edge.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.02,0:26:35.22,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,最后，Lambda 步骤 DeployModel，从模型步骤拿模型名\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Last, the Lambda step named DeployModel takes the model name from the model step.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.54,0:26:38.09,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后这个 pipeline 列出全部五个步骤\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Then the pipeline lists all five steps,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.09,0:26:40.89,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,从你的笔记本创建负责部署的 Lambda\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}creates the deploy Lambda from your laptop,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.89,0:26:43.37,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,upsert 它的定义，再启动它\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}upserts its definition, and starts it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.17,0:26:45.77,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,想一想\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Something to ponder.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.83,0:26:48.39,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,把 Pipeline 调用里的步骤列表倒过来\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Reverse the list of steps in the Pipeline call.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.71,0:26:50.31,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,运行顺序会变吗？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Does the run order change?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.05,0:27:04.98,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,不会。顺序来自引用：每个输入都指向另一个步骤的输出\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}No. The order comes from the references: each input names the output of another step.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.30,0:27:07.97,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个列表是一组步骤，不是一份时间表\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The list is a set of steps, not a schedule.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.22,0:27:13.79,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,额外看一样东西，离线生成、从没发出去：SDK 生成的 JSON 定义\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}An extra, built offline and never sent: the JSON definition from the SDK.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.11,0:27:17.50,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,五个步骤，每条边都是一次 Get，取另一个步骤的某个属性\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Five steps, each edge a get on a property of another step.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.82,0:27:19.42,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Upsert 发送的就是它\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Upsert sends this.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.32,0:27:22.09,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,课上画的是四个步骤\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The lecture draws four steps.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.41,0:27:24.26,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在这里，部署拆成了两步\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Here, deploy splits in two.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.58,0:27:26.78,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,CreateModel 创建模型\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}CreateModel makes the model,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.78,0:27:29.85,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而一个 Lambda，也就是 AWS 按需运行的小函数\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and a Lambda, a small function AWS runs
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.85,0:27:33.22,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,负责创建或更新 endpoint\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}on demand, creates or updates the endpoint.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.47,0:27:36.07,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,如实说明一点\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}One honest caveat.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.22,0:27:41.82,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,边决定顺序，但文件也会按固定的名字经过 bucket 传递\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The edges set the order, but files also travel by fixed names through the bucket:
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.82,0:27:44.39,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,raw.zip、clean.zip 和 tfrecords.zip\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}raw.zip, clean.zip and tfrecords.zip.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.71,0:27:47.16,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,没有账号，我们没法检查\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}We could not check, without an account,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.16,0:27:50.23,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,训练任务是怎么在 SageMaker 上找到它的数据的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}how the training job finds its data on SageMaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.47,0:27:56.65,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 1 步：python cli.py --pipeline 停在同样的第 32 行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 1: python cli.py --pipeline stops at the same line 32.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.97,0:27:59.73,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,有密钥时，它会打印 pipeline 已经启动\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}With keys, it prints that the pipeline started.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.05,0:28:04.37,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,如果 upsert 反而因为 Lambda 的运行时失败\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}If instead upsert fails on the Lambda runtime,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.37,0:28:09.45,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,就在 Lambda 调用里把运行时设为 python 3.12，在第 297 行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}add runtime="python3.12" to the Lambda call, line 297.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.77,0:28:11.60,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 2 步：在 Unified Studio 里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 2: in Unified Studio,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.60,0:28:15.26,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Build 下面的 ML Pipelines，你会看到这张图\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}under Build, ML Pipelines, you would see this graph.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.50,0:28:19.85,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,如果每一步都成功，缓存会在 30 天内跳过没变的步骤\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}If every step succeeds, caching skips unchanged steps for 30 days,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.85,0:28:22.22,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,所以采集器不会再抓取一遍\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}so the collector won't scrape again.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.54,0:28:26.19,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而且绿色的 DeployModel 只说明 Lambda 发出了请求\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}And a green DeployModel only means the Lambda asked:
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.19,0:28:28.86,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,要等到 endpoint 进入服务状态\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}wait until the endpoint is in service.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.10,0:28:32.28,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 3 步用各自的参数分别测试每个组件\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 3 tests each component with its own flag.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.60,0:28:34.80,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在这里，四个都停在那一行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Here, all four stop at that line.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.12,0:28:38.30,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,有密钥时，模型部署又会建一个新的 endpoint\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}With keys, model deploy makes yet another endpoint.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.63,0:28:41.23,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,走之前，先收尾清理\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Before you leave, clean up.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.55,0:28:44.24,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,列出你的 endpoint，全部删掉\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}List your endpoints and delete every one:
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.24,0:28:48.04,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 1 部分那些带时间戳的，还有 cheese-app-endpoint\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the timestamped ones from part 1, and cheese-app-endpoint.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.36,0:28:51.15,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后删掉它们的配置和模型\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Then delete their configurations and models.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.40,0:28:53.41,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,清空并删除两个 bucket\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Empty and delete both buckets.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.73,0:28:58.09,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,删除两个 ECR 仓库、负责部署的 Lambda 函数\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Delete the two ECR repositories, the deploy Lambda functions,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.09,0:28:59.81,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,还有 cheese 的 pipeline\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and the cheese pipeline.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.05,0:29:05.30,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,停用并删除访问密钥，还有不再需要的用户和角色\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Deactivate and delete the access keys, and the users and roles you no longer need.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.62,0:29:08.38,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,最后，检查你创建的两个域\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Finally, check the SageMaker AI domain
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.38,0:29:11.44,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,SageMaker AI 域和 Unified Studio 域\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and the Unified Studio domain you created.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.28,0:29:18.19,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,课上最后讲的是一座工厂：你的 Python 是配方\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The lecture ends on a factory: your Python is the recipe,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.19,0:29:20.38,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,SageMaker Pipelines 来运行它\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and SageMaker Pipelines runs it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.70,0:29:24.69,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,今天的几幅图：笔记本上的一把密钥，云端的一个角色\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Today's pictures: a key on the laptop and a role in the cloud.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.01,0:29:26.61,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,星号不是 pin\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A star is not a pin.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.81,0:29:29.84,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,预处理放在客户端，或者放在模型里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Preprocessing sits in the client or in the model.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.16,0:29:34.66,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,站在 endpoint 背后的是三样东西，而引用画出了边\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Three pieces stand behind an endpoint, and references draw the edges.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.90,0:29:37.18,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在它下面，是用四条命令走完的第 1 部分\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Under it, part 1 in four commands.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.50,0:29:42.43,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,其中 prepare 打包模型，deploy 建出模型、配置和 endpoint\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Prepare packs the model, deploy builds the model, configuration and endpoint.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.75,0:29:46.10,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而 predict 发送那些数字，delete 关掉计价器\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Predict sends the numbers, and delete turns off the meter.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.35,0:29:47.73,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,自测一下\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Test yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.78,0:29:53.03,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,你的笔记本和 endpoint 都会访问 S3：各自用的是哪个身份？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Your laptop and the endpoint both reach S3: which identity does each use?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.35,0:29:57.42,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,为什么选项 2 的 export，永远到不了第 1 部分的 container？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}And why do the option 2 exports never reach the part 1 container?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.67,0:29:59.82,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,说出 deploy 创建的三样东西\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Name the three things deploy creates.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.14,0:30:04.00,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,哪一个是地址，哪一个在没人调用时也在计费？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Which one is the address, and which one bills while nobody calls it?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.32,0:30:06.72,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,预处理在第 1 部分里放在哪里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Where does preprocessing sit in part 1,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.72,0:30:10.30,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在第 2 部分的训练脚本里又放在哪里，为什么要挪进模型？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and in the part 2 trainer, and why move it into the model?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.53,0:30:13.20,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,哪几行让训练等着数据处理器？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Which lines make training wait for the processor?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.52,0:30:15.96,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,今天需要哪两处一行修复\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Which two one-line fixes did today need,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.96,0:30:18.51,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Apple Silicon 的 Mac 会跳过哪一处？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and which would an Apple silicon Mac skip?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.83,0:30:24.83,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,答案在练习里，第 23 讲会从 GitHub 触发这个 pipeline\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The answers are in the exercises, and lecture 23 triggers the pipeline from GitHub.
